census 1804 4 1 0 1 0 0
census 1805 11 0 0 0 0 0
census 1806 6 0 0 0 0 0
census 1807 3 1 1 0 0 0
census 1808 2 0 0 0 0 0
census 1809 5 0 0 0 0 0
